{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43363","headline":"寄内诗 · 河北士人","name":"寄内诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"握笔题诗易，荷戈征戍难。\n惯从鸳被暖，怯向鴈门寒。\n瘦尽宽衣带，啼多渍枕檀。\n试留青黛着，回日画眉看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"河北士人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}